WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.275
This is Cairn.

00:00:01.344 --> 00:00:02.951
Little stack of rocks.

00:00:03.401 --> 00:00:04.544
Stick arms.

00:00:04.608 --> 00:00:07.083
Lives in a room with a desk and a keyboard.

00:00:07.152 --> 00:00:08.448
Not your teacher.

00:00:08.898 --> 00:00:11.693
Just a guy who keeps going back to the thing he likes.

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:14.149
Tuesday the keyboard was just a keyboard.

00:00:14.208 --> 00:00:15.697
It was on the desk.

00:00:15.768 --> 00:00:17.923
Cairn walked in because he felt like it.

00:00:17.976 --> 00:00:19.469
Nobody texted him.

00:00:19.536 --> 00:00:21.294
He played until it got dark.

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:22.808
Didn't check the time.

00:00:22.872 --> 00:00:24.856
Didn't owe the chair a full hour.

00:00:24.912 --> 00:00:26.597
Left when the song was done.

00:00:27.047 --> 00:00:28.603
Or when he got bored.

00:00:29.053 --> 00:00:30.229
That's allowed.

00:00:30.288 --> 00:00:31.755
That's the fun part.

00:00:32.205 --> 00:00:33.529
You just show up.

00:00:33.979 --> 00:00:35.210
You don't plan it.

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:36.697
Then he got serious.

00:00:36.768 --> 00:00:38.217
Opened his calendar.

00:00:38.667 --> 00:00:39.770
Made a block.

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:41.222
Tuesday.

00:00:41.672 --> 00:00:42.539
Seven.

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:44.669
Wrote KEYS on it like it was standup.

00:00:44.736 --> 00:00:45.917
Yellow square.

00:00:46.367 --> 00:00:47.519
Start time.

00:00:47.969 --> 00:00:49.200
End time.

00:00:49.248 --> 00:00:52.491
Even put the room in the invite like someone else was coming.

00:00:52.560 --> 00:00:53.995
He was proud of that.

00:00:54.445 --> 00:00:55.632
Felt grown.

00:00:56.082 --> 00:00:58.738
Like, okay, I'm not flaking on this anymore.

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:00.858
Wednesday he checked the square twice.

00:01:01.308 --> 00:01:02.344
Still there.

00:01:02.794 --> 00:01:03.638
Nice.

00:01:04.088 --> 00:01:05.591
He had a practice now.

00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:06.871
Told a friend.

00:01:07.321 --> 00:01:08.887
I blocked time for it.

00:01:09.337 --> 00:01:10.753
Friend said fire.

00:01:11.203 --> 00:01:12.919
Cairn felt like an adult.

00:01:12.984 --> 00:01:16.184
Wednesday night he walked past the keyboard and didn't touch it.

00:01:16.248 --> 00:01:17.825
He had a block tomorrow.

00:01:18.275 --> 00:01:19.235
Saving it.

00:01:19.685 --> 00:01:21.465
That felt responsible too.

00:01:21.528 --> 00:01:23.448
Thursday the square actually hit.

00:01:23.496 --> 00:01:24.923
Clock hits seven.

00:01:24.984 --> 00:01:26.515
Chair's already out.

00:01:26.568 --> 00:01:28.680
Cairn sits down like it's a meeting.

00:01:28.728 --> 00:01:30.230
Hands on the keys.

00:01:30.680 --> 00:01:32.020
Waiting to want it.

00:01:32.088 --> 00:01:33.545
He does not want it.

00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:34.920
Same keyboard.

00:01:35.370 --> 00:01:36.483
Same room.

00:01:36.933 --> 00:01:38.457
Totally different vibe.

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:40.033
Hands know what to do.

00:01:40.483 --> 00:01:42.105
Brain is in the standup.

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:43.754
He's watching the clock.

00:01:43.824 --> 00:01:47.067
He plays the whole hour anyway because the calendar said so.

00:01:47.136 --> 00:01:48.270
Block ends.

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:50.853
He stands up like the call is over.

00:01:50.904 --> 00:01:52.191
Closes the lid.

00:01:52.641 --> 00:01:53.963
Leaves on time.

00:01:54.024 --> 00:01:55.397
He did the hour.

00:01:55.847 --> 00:01:57.377
Could've checked a box.

00:01:57.827 --> 00:01:59.427
Didn't feel like he played.

00:01:59.877 --> 00:02:01.325
Felt like he attended.

00:02:01.392 --> 00:02:04.507
Friday morning he walks past the desk and feels guilty.

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:06.329
Not fail-a-test guilty.

00:02:06.779 --> 00:02:08.998
Keyboard's just sitting there looking at him.

00:02:09.448 --> 00:02:11.357
Like a task he didn't finish.

00:02:11.424 --> 00:02:12.730
He makes coffee.

00:02:13.180 --> 00:02:14.769
Walks past it again.

00:02:15.219 --> 00:02:16.573
Still feels it.

00:02:16.632 --> 00:02:18.360
Saturday he does it again.

00:02:18.810 --> 00:02:20.043
Not at seven.

00:02:20.493 --> 00:02:21.593
Just looks.

00:02:22.043 --> 00:02:23.599
Keyboard didn't move.

00:02:24.049 --> 00:02:25.388
The feeling did.

00:02:25.440 --> 00:02:27.252
Used to walk over and want it.

00:02:27.702 --> 00:02:29.814
Now he walks over and it's homework.

00:02:29.880 --> 00:02:33.187
Puts his mug down and leaves so he doesn't owe it another minute.

00:02:33.240 --> 00:02:35.352
Someone on a writing board said it.

00:02:35.802 --> 00:02:37.957
What's a passion will turn into a chore.

00:02:38.407 --> 00:02:42.289
An artist said they booked an hour to be creative and then sat there in nothing.

00:02:42.739 --> 00:02:46.494
Another person said they feel guilty every time they see the keyboard.

00:02:46.560 --> 00:02:48.021
Cairn was like yeah.

00:02:48.471 --> 00:02:49.656
That's the walk.

00:02:49.704 --> 00:02:51.368
He didn't fall off the thing.

00:02:51.818 --> 00:02:54.015
He put it on the calendar like work.

00:02:54.465 --> 00:02:56.471
So his brain did work-brain.

00:02:56.921 --> 00:02:58.012
Clocked in.

00:02:58.080 --> 00:02:59.487
That's the whole story.

00:02:59.937 --> 00:03:00.984
One move.

00:03:01.434 --> 00:03:02.567
One result.

00:03:02.616 --> 00:03:05.112
People who study this gave it a boring name.

00:03:05.562 --> 00:03:06.957
Calendar mindset.

00:03:07.407 --> 00:03:10.735
They had people put a clock time on stuff that used to be free.

00:03:11.185 --> 00:03:12.035
Dinner.

00:03:12.485 --> 00:03:13.444
A walk.

00:03:13.894 --> 00:03:15.096
A hobby hour.

00:03:15.546 --> 00:03:18.156
Once it had a start time, it felt like a job.

00:03:18.606 --> 00:03:20.377
The fun didn't leave the thing.

00:03:20.827 --> 00:03:22.917
The fun left when the block showed up.

00:03:22.968 --> 00:03:24.803
Cairn doesn't need their chart.

00:03:25.253 --> 00:03:26.831
He has the yellow square.

00:03:27.281 --> 00:03:28.585
That's the chart.

00:03:28.656 --> 00:03:30.341
So he does the small thing.

00:03:30.408 --> 00:03:31.889
Opens the calendar.

00:03:32.339 --> 00:03:34.119
Deletes Tuesday at seven.

00:03:34.176 --> 00:03:35.405
Square's gone.

00:03:35.855 --> 00:03:37.238
Week looks empty.

00:03:37.688 --> 00:03:38.927
That's the point.

00:03:39.377 --> 00:03:41.319
He doesn't make a better standup.

00:03:41.769 --> 00:03:43.369
Doesn't write KEYS 2.

00:03:43.819 --> 00:03:46.144
Doesn't set a reminder to be inspired.

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:48.551
If he wants the keyboard, he walks over.

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:50.391
If he doesn't, he walks past.

00:03:50.841 --> 00:03:52.611
He doesn't owe it an hour.

00:03:52.680 --> 00:03:54.213
That night he tests it.

00:03:54.663 --> 00:03:56.066
Goes to the desk.

00:03:56.516 --> 00:03:57.615
Doesn't sit.

00:03:58.065 --> 00:03:58.993
Leaves.

00:03:59.443 --> 00:04:00.575
No guilt.

00:04:01.025 --> 00:04:02.988
Keyboard's just furniture again.

00:04:03.048 --> 00:04:04.776
Later he walks over at four.

00:04:05.226 --> 00:04:06.374
No reason.

00:04:06.432 --> 00:04:08.736
Plays one song because he's already there.

00:04:09.186 --> 00:04:10.613
Stops when it's done.

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:12.236
Puts that on the pile.

00:04:12.686 --> 00:04:13.874
One stone.

00:04:14.324 --> 00:04:15.753
A session that happened.

00:04:16.203 --> 00:04:17.474
Not a streak.

00:04:17.924 --> 00:04:20.185
Not a 7pm personality.

00:04:20.256 --> 00:04:22.325
Keyboard's just a keyboard again.

00:04:22.392 --> 00:04:24.002
The passion didn't die.

00:04:24.452 --> 00:04:26.159
He booked it like a standup.

00:04:26.208 --> 00:04:28.755
If this week's takeaway stuck, subscribe.

00:04:29.205 --> 00:04:31.211
Next one lands same time.

